  "description": "In this city where it’s almost always rainy or overcast, there’s a man who dresses entirely in black, always carries an umbrella and wears sunglasses, and has sharp, pointed fangs. One day, he blatantly starts following me around.\n\n*“You smell delicious.”*\n\nAll my senses are telling me the same thing. The guy who lives next door is seriously suspicious!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/strange_nb/), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/suspicious_neighborhood)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/stranger_next_door), [T.Chinese](https://www.bomtoon.tw/detail/strange_nb)",
